## WS-02 Matrix and Hand Views

### 02.1 View Mode Foundation
- [x] Add table view selector with `matrix` and `hand` options. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS02-02-1-01]
- [x] Default view initializes to `matrix` on first load. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS02-02-1-02]
- [x] Persist selected view mode in `sessionStorage`. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS02-02-1-03]
- [x] Animate transitions between matrix and hand views. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS02-02-1-04]
- [ ] Implement fixed row-size matrix renderer with deterministic left-to-right fill. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS02-02-1-05]

### 02.2 Hand Layouts (V1)
- [x] Add hand layout selector with four modes. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS02-02-2-01]
- [x] Implement `fan-arch` layout. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS02-02-2-02]
- [x] Implement `fan-linear` layout. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS02-02-2-03]
- [x] Implement `row-overlap` layout. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS02-02-2-04]
- [x] Implement `row-spaced` layout. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS02-02-2-05]
- [x] Add arch-curve selector with `subtle`, `medium`, and `strong` options. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS02-02-2-06]
- [x] Animate switching between hand layouts. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS02-02-2-07]
- [x] Auto-fallback `fan-arch` to `row-overlap` in tight mobile space with resize re-evaluation. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS02-02-2-08]

## WS-03 Sorting and Grouping (Backlog)

