- [ ] Implement ascending/descending sort direction toggle. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS03-03-1-03]
- [ ] Apply sorting to both matrix and hand views. [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS03-03-1-04]
- [ ] Keep sorting authoritative while active (manual reorder disabled). [A:2026-02-25][U:2026-02-25][T:POC][ID:CTP-WS03-03-1-05]

